<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2164280955"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1750645722"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Boom Boom Pow"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="初星学園 / 長月あおい"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Boom Boom Pow"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:21.322"><div begin="00:02.438" end="03:13.866"><p begin="00:02.438" end="00:04.056" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">届け、このMusic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我将音乐传达出去</span></p><p begin="00:04.277" end="00:06.325" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">聴こえる？ Boom Boom Boom Pow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到？ 如此强而有力的节奏</span></p><p begin="00:06.325" end="00:08.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">燃え上がってくFeeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉如烈火般灼灼燃烧</span></p><p begin="00:08.558" end="00:10.115" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Ready? Come on let’s go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">准备好了吗? 来吧 让我们开始</span></p><p begin="00:10.310" end="00:12.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">始まりのSound ringing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宣告开始的声音响起</span></p><p begin="00:12.333" end="00:14.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">高鳴り出す Heartbeat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳已变得愈发剧烈</span></p><p begin="00:14.415" end="00:16.215" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">新しいページ Starting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始书写新的人生篇章</span></p><p begin="00:16.483" end="00:18.708" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">幕開ける物語、My story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的故事即将拉开帷幕</span></p><p begin="00:18.485" end="00:22.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">消せない自分のインクで描いてる My Futureに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用自己那难以涂抹的墨水</span></p><p begin="00:22.619" end="00:25.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">誰にも真似出来ない One and only<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">独树一帜 没有任何人可以模仿</span></p><p begin="00:25.594" end="00:27.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">私のFlow, 私のGlow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的节奏 我的荣光</span></p><p begin="00:27.904" end="00:29.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">輝く未来はすぐそこ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">光辉的未来呈现于眼前</span></p><p begin="00:29.883" end="00:30.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">目の奥<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼底深处闪耀炙热火光</span></p><p begin="00:30.437" end="00:31.146" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Hot, Hot, Hot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦点燃之后便是势不可挡</span></p><p begin="00:31.146" end="00:33.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">火がついたらもう止まらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一旦点燃便无法停止</span></p><p begin="00:33.228" end="00:34.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Can you feel the heat Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否感受到这份热情呢</span></p><p begin="00:34.594" end="00:36.493" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">奏でるこのMelodyを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此将这首旋律奏响</span></p><p begin="00:36.598" end="00:38.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">忘れる事出来ない音<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随难以忘怀的音符</span></p><p begin="00:38.807" end="00:40.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">So original uh uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些都是我的原创</span></p><p begin="00:40.793" end="00:42.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">聴いたことないでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你从来都没有听到过吧？</span></p><p begin="00:43.166" end="00:47.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">周りがとやかく、言ったとしても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算周围的人再怎么议论纷纷</span></p><p begin="00:47.913" end="00:50.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">覚悟決めたの自分だし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下定决心的人依然是我自己</span></p><p begin="00:50.826" end="00:52.365" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Ohhh)</span></p><p begin="00:51.553" end="00:52.533" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">Oh yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh yeah</span></p><p begin="00:52.379" end="00:53.821" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们飞得更加高远</span></p><p begin="00:53.067" end="00:54.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Let's go, fly away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起展翅高飞吧</span></p><p begin="00:54.916" end="00:55.974" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝着高处一往无前</span></p><p begin="00:55.620" end="00:58.811" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">高みへ Go high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向更高处飞跃</span></p><p begin="00:58.879" end="01:00.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Gonna, Gonna, Gonna 踏み出せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出脚下的步伐</span></p><p begin="01:01.000" end="01:02.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Follow, Follow, Follow 信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚信自己的力量</span></p><p begin="01:03.026" end="01:05.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">私らしく I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走出我的风格</span></p><p begin="01:05.780" end="01:07.063" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L32">(恐れないで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(不需要畏惧)</span></p><p begin="01:07.063" end="01:09.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Wanna, Wanna, Wanna 飛び立て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此启程高飞吧</span></p><p begin="01:09.074" end="01:11.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I know, I know, I know, I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我是谁</span></p><p begin="01:11.096" end="01:13.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">揺らがないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会有任何动摇</span></p><p begin="01:13.368" end="01:15.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">始めるよ We are starting now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就让我们一起开始</span></p><p begin="01:15.727" end="01:17.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">届け、このMusic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我将音乐传达出去</span></p><p begin="01:17.513" end="01:19.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">聴こえる？ Boom Boom Boom Pow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到？ 如此强而有力的节奏</span></p><p begin="01:19.548" end="01:21.266" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">燃え上がってくFeeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉如烈火般灼灼燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:21.587" end="01:23.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">Everybody, can you hear this sound?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各位 都能听到这样的声音吗?</span></p><p begin="01:23.850" end="01:25.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">響け、このBeating<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让心跳剧烈响彻</span></p><p begin="01:25.561" end="01:27.571" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">聴こえる？ Boom Boom Boom Pow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到？ 如此强而有力的节奏</span></p><p begin="01:27.774" end="01:29.388" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">心の中Burning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在心中剧烈燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:29.931" end="01:32.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Gonna have some fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们要尽情享受其中</span></p><p begin="01:32.935" end="01:35.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">目指すのはTop, top to the top<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目标则是巅峰的所在</span></p><p begin="01:35.737" end="01:37.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">誰も届かない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无人能及</span></p><p begin="01:37.177" end="01:39.782" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">I won’t stop, stop never gonna stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会停下 永远步履不停</span></p><p begin="01:39.795" end="01:41.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">どんな時でもヒロインはMe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论何时我都是女主角</span></p><p begin="01:41.652" end="01:43.611" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">後ろは振り返らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会轻易回头</span></p><p begin="01:43.611" end="01:45.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">チャンスは目の前にしかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝佳机会就呈现于眼前</span></p><p begin="01:45.975" end="01:47.916" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">Gonna catch it so uh uh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要好好将其把握</span></p><p begin="01:48.018" end="01:49.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">掴み取るまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至彻底紧握</span></p><p begin="01:50.328" end="01:54.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">私は私の、道を進む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会前行在我的路上</span></p><p begin="01:55.065" end="01:57.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">誰かのためじゃないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非为了其他任何人</span></p><p begin="01:57.971" end="01:59.204" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(Ohhh)</span></p><p begin="01:58.640" end="01:59.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">Oh yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Oh yeah</span></p><p begin="01:59.443" end="02:00.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走在我的路上</span></p><p begin="02:00.193" end="02:01.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">Let’s go, Go my way<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前行在我独有的路上</span></p><p begin="02:02.036" end="02:03.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">(Ohhh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚信我自己</span></p><p begin="02:02.724" end="02:05.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">信じるMyself<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信自己的内心</span></p><p begin="02:06.002" end="02:07.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">Gonna, Gonna, Gonna 踏み出せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出脚下的步伐</span></p><p begin="02:08.060" end="02:10.077" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">Follow, Follow, Follow 信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚信自己的力量</span></p><p begin="02:10.152" end="02:12.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">私らしく I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走出我的风格</span></p><p begin="02:12.921" end="02:14.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">(恐れないで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(不需要畏惧)</span></p><p begin="02:14.145" end="02:16.149" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">Wanna, Wanna, Wanna 飛び立て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此启程高飞吧</span></p><p begin="02:16.244" end="02:18.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">I know, I know, I know, I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我是谁</span></p><p begin="02:18.246" end="02:20.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">揺らがないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会有任何动摇</span></p><p begin="02:20.488" end="02:22.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">始めるよ We are starting now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就让我们一起开始</span></p><p begin="02:23.116" end="02:26.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">たまに挫けそうに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管有些时候</span></p><p begin="02:27.111" end="02:30.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">なる時もあるけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">挫折也在所难免</span></p><p begin="02:31.201" end="02:33.185" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">あなたの手を、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是紧握你的手之后</span></p><p begin="02:33.185" end="02:37.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">掴み乗り越えて行ける<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就能克服一切艰难险阻</span></p><p begin="02:37.573" end="02:40.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">Ohhh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ohhh</span></p><p begin="02:40.604" end="02:46.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">Gonna, Gonna, Gonna 踏み出せ (Yeah ah ah oow)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈出脚下的步伐</span></p><p begin="02:42.672" end="02:44.672" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">Follow, Follow, Follow 信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">坚信自己的力量</span></p><p begin="02:44.738" end="02:48.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">私らしく I go (I go I go)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走出我的风格</span></p><p begin="02:47.433" end="02:48.996" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">(恐れないで)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(不需要畏惧)</span></p><p begin="02:48.807" end="02:50.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">Wanna, Wanna, Wanna 飛び立て<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此启程高飞吧</span></p><p begin="02:50.733" end="02:52.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">I know, I know, I know, I am<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道我是谁</span></p><p begin="02:52.823" end="02:54.718" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">揺らがないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会有任何动摇</span></p><p begin="02:55.069" end="02:57.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L81">始めるよ We are starting now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就让我们一起开始</span></p><p begin="02:57.432" end="02:58.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L82">届け、このMusic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我将音乐传达出去</span></p><p begin="02:59.073" end="03:01.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L83">聴こえる？ Boom Boom Boom Pow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到？ 如此强而有力的节奏</span></p><p begin="03:01.246" end="03:02.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L84">燃え上がってくFeeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉如烈火般灼灼燃烧</span></p><p begin="03:03.157" end="03:05.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L85">Everybody, can you hear this sound?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各位 都能听到这样的声音吗?</span></p><p begin="03:05.509" end="03:07.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L86">響け、このBeating<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">剧烈响彻的心跳</span></p><p begin="03:07.281" end="03:09.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L87">聴こえる？ Boom Boom Boom Pow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你能否听到？ 如此强而有力的节奏</span></p><p begin="03:09.625" end="03:11.088" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L88">心の中Burning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在心中剧烈燃烧</span></p><p begin="03:11.594" end="03:13.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L89">Gonna have some fun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们要尽情享受其中</span></p></div></body></tt>